1
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:02,570
(Raj:)Oh.

2
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:04,640
(Howard:)Go away, Sheldon.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:07,930
There's a $9.95 e-book
down the drain.

4
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,060
(Raj:)What's in the bag?

5
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,230
(Sheldon:)It's for Howard.

6
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:13,400
(Howard:)Oh. Sheldon, you can't
fix this with gifts.

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,570
(Sheldon:)Nevertheless, I've hurt you,

8
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:16,790
(Sheldon:)and whether you
forgive me or not,

9
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:18,820
(Raj:)I want you to
have this.

10
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:22,390
(Howard:)You're giving me
a couch cushion?

11
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,760
(Leonard:)No.

12
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,560
(Sheldon:)The cushion is merely symbolic.

13
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:28,600
(Sheldon:)I'm giving you my spot
on the couch.

14
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:32,500
(Howard:)But you love that spot.

15
00:00:32,510 --> 00:00:35,040
(Sheldon:)No. I love my mother.

16
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:39,080
(Sheldon:)My feelings for my spot
are much greater.

17
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:42,150
(Sheldon:)It is the singular location
in space

18
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:45,080
(Sheldon:)around which revolves
my entire universe.

19
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,750
(Sheldon:)And now it's yours.

20
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:51,690
(Raj:)Oh, my God, dude.
Now you have to forgive him.

21
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:54,230
(Woman at Door:)All right.

22
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,360
(Sheldon:)Apology accepted.

23
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,360
(Sheldon:)High five.

24
00:00:58,360 --> 00:01:00,370
(Sheldon:)Not too hard.

25
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,300
(Woman at Door:)Thank you.

26
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:06,960
I haven't cried like this
since Toy Story 3.

27
00:01:15,740 --> 00:01:16,910
(Howard:)I got to tell you,

28
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:19,270
(Howard:)Sheldon, I understand why
you chose this spot.

29
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:22,160
(Howard:)I mean, the temperature is
good, but there's no draft.

30
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,660
(Howard:)I can see the television,
but I can still talk to...

31
00:01:24,660 --> 00:01:27,350
(Sheldon:)I changed my mind.
Get out of my spot.

32
00:01:28,450 --> 00:01:30,320
(Penny:)How long?

33
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:32,030
(Leonard:)94 seconds.

